      "latex_extracted": null,
      "source_page_number": null,
      "source_image_index": null,
      "ownership": "unknown"
    },
    "parts": [],
    "answer_text": "The following are the two methods to find out the direction of wind: (i) While flying a kite, air exerts pressure on the kite due to which the kite flies. The direction in which the kite flies is the direction of blowing of wind. (ii) While riding a bicycle, the direction in which it is difficult to ride is opposite to the direction of the blowing wind.",
    "answer_latex": null,
    "steps": [],
    "final_answer": "Therefore, while flying a kite or riding a bicycle, the wind direction at a given place can be determined.",
